{"id":"4e86f89884c626ed","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-model-validity.md","title":"df-model-validity","display":"df-model-validity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-model-validity","aliases":["16-df-model-validity"],"display":"df-model-validity","depends_on":["[[16-df-algebraic-model]]","[[16-df-set]]"],"source":"§3.3 p.183 (PDF203); set instance of the algebraic-model arrow interpretation","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-model-validity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-model-validity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-model-validity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"396e57d7540c9d0e\" href=\"?note=396e57d7540c9d0e\" title=\"16-df-algebraic-model\">16-df-algebraic-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§3.3 p.183 (PDF203); set instance of the algebraic-model arrow interpretation"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,A,\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma,A,\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"396e57d7540c9d0e\" href=\"?note=396e57d7540c9d0e\" title=\"16-df-algebraic-model\">16-df-algebraic-model</a> 及其明确引用的代数项语法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AlgModel}_{\\Sigma,A}(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U},M)\">\\(\\mathsf{AlgModel}_{\\Sigma,A}(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U},M)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a> 的带源靶标签箭头编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e=(\\Gamma,\\sigma,l,r)\\in\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma\">\\(e=(\\Gamma,\\sigma,l,r)\\in\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，排版记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash l=_\\sigma r\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash l=_\\sigma r\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(\\sigma)\">\\(M(\\sigma)\\)</span> 简写单排序语境的对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M((\\sigma))\">\\(M((\\sigma))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\Gamma\">\\(M\\Gamma\\)</span> 为语境解释对象。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦ t⟧_{M,\\Gamma,\\sigma}\">\\(⟦ t⟧_{M,\\Gamma,\\sigma}\\)</span> 是上游已构造的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}(M\\Gamma,M(\\sigma))\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}(M\\Gamma,M(\\sigma))\\)</span> 中箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_3\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_3\\)</span> 是三元组的第三投影；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(t)\">\\(v^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(t)\\)</span> 是下文定义的底层函数图，不能把带标签的范畴箭头直接当作函数图取值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(t)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{pr}_3(⟦ t⟧_{M,\\Gamma,\\sigma}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(t)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{pr}_3(⟦ t⟧_{M,\\Gamma,\\sigma}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nM\\models e&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow M\\models_\\Sigma e\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ l⟧_{M,\\Gamma,\\sigma}=⟦ r⟧_{M,\\Gamma,\\sigma}\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall\\gamma\\in M\\Gamma)\\\nv^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(l)(\\gamma)=v^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(r)(\\gamma).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nM\\models e&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow M\\models_\\Sigma e\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ l⟧_{M,\\Gamma,\\sigma}=⟦ r⟧_{M,\\Gamma,\\sigma}\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall\\gamma\\in M\\Gamma)\\\nv^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(l)(\\gamma)=v^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(r)(\\gamma).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §3.3 p.183（PDF203）以解释箭头的相等定义代数等式有效性。本页采用本书已建立的代数项解释，移除不兼容的 STLC 语法与命名变量一阶满足依赖；既不重新假定一套无来源的项解释，也不需要新建外书原子。</p>\n<p>Set 的两个箭头有相同源靶，故箭头相等当且仅当底层函数图相等；函数外延性给出逐赋值的末式。空语境和空载体均由上游语境解释处理；当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\Gamma\">\\(M\\Gamma\\)</span> 为空时逐赋值条件真空成立，两个同源靶的空函数也相等。本页只处理无前提的代数等式；带条件等式的局部有效性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cbb370bf4db323fd\" href=\"?note=cbb370bf4db323fd\" title=\"16-df-eq-validity\">16-df-eq-validity</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-algebraic-model","status":"resolved","id":"396e57d7540c9d0e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-algebraic-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-algebraic-model","status":"resolved","id":"396e57d7540c9d0e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma,A,\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma$ 采用 [[16-df-algebraic-model]] 及其明确引用的代数项语法；$M$ 满足 $\\mathsf{AlgModel}_{\\Sigma,A}(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U},M)$。$\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 采用 [[16-df-set]] 的带源靶标签箭头编码。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma,A,\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma$ 采用 [[16-df-algebraic-model]] 及其明确引用的代数项语法；$M$ 满足 $\\mathsf{AlgModel}_{\\Sigma,A}(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U},M)$。$\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 采用 [[16-df-set]] 的带源靶标签箭头编码。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-eq-validity","status":"resolved","id":"cbb370bf4db323fd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"Set 的两个箭头有相同源靶，故箭头相等当且仅当底层函数图相等；函数外延性给出逐赋值的末式。空语境和空载体均由上游语境解释处理；当 $M\\Gamma$ 为空时逐赋值条件真空成立，两个同源靶的空函数也相等。本页只处理无前提的代数等式；带条件等式的局部有效性见 [[16-df-eq-validity]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,A,\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AlgModel}_{\\Sigma,A}(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U},M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"e=(\\Gamma,\\sigma,l,r)\\in\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash l=_\\sigma r","display":false},{"tex":"M(\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"M((\\sigma))","display":false},{"tex":"M\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"⟦ t⟧_{M,\\Gamma,\\sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}(M\\Gamma,M(\\sigma))","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pr}_3","display":false},{"tex":"v^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"v^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(t)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{pr}_3(⟦ t⟧_{M,\\Gamma,\\sigma}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nM\\models e&\\Longleftrightarrow M\\models_\\Sigma e\\\\\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ l⟧_{M,\\Gamma,\\sigma}=⟦ r⟧_{M,\\Gamma,\\sigma}\\\\\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall\\gamma\\in M\\Gamma)\\\nv^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(l)(\\gamma)=v^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(r)(\\gamma).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"M\\Gamma","display":false}],"bytes":2247,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-284","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-model-validity|df-model-validity]]"}],"outgoing":["396e57d7540c9d0e","09b2ae01fb2d54e3","cbb370bf4db323fd"]}